OL,3,GNEWSAYoung girl was killed by mum who
OL,4,Atook own life - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fthat some may find disturbing.
OL,9,FA young girl described as a "ray of
OL,10,Fsunshine" was unlawfully killed by her
OL,11,Fmother who took her own life, a coroner
OL,12,Fhas concluded.
OL,14,FThe girl, who cannot be named for legal
OL,15,Freasons, died last year as a result of
OL,16,Fher mother deliberately injecting her
OL,17,Fwith insulin, an inquest held at Oxford
OL,18,FCoroner's Court found.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
